  (text "NOTES:"
    (at 12.70 190.50 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.524 1.524)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "cef3f687-b1c9-4c5c-9311-614410d90490")
  )
  (text "1. VDDPIX is the sensor's internal-LDO OUTPUT: bypass caps only, never on a rail."
    (at 12.70 196.85 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "e6e6f0c6-39a5-47b2-a89e-d465298fdc12")
  )
  (text "2. IR LED is integrated in the module; LED_P (anode) via 39R from VSEN_1V9."
    (at 12.70 201.93 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "bf8993fc-4273-4d30-a39c-b9f17548e92e")
  )
  (text "3. NCS has no internal pull-up: external 10k. MOTION/MISO are push-pull (no PU)."
    (at 12.70 207.01 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "dbcc52d4-e807-47ec-98f6-d4667d1a8faa")
  )
  (text "4. NRESET: APX809 push-pull + internal weak PU; no external PU fitted."
    (at 12.70 212.09 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "02fb6897-7532-4a9a-8b76-261bdd3777f8")
  )
  (text "5. Standalone ERC: 5 expected input-not-driven (drivers on power/mcu); clear at full-project ERC."
    (at 12.70 217.17 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "badc8764-dd94-4f57-86a7-e6fa1bc7c5ed")
  )
  (text "6. PMW3360 footprint custom (layout job); lens Z=2.4+-0.1mm (MECH-002)."
    (at 12.70 222.25 0)
    (effects
        (font
          (size 1.0 1.0)
        )
        (justify left top))
    (uuid "7ca10348-8825-47e2-a0a0-6ef3006de506")
  )
